<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Linux - 分类 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/categories/linux/</link><description>Linux - 分类 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</managingEditor><webMaster>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</webMaster><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 21:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://spaceack.github.io/categories/linux/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Linux命令行参数的总长度的上限值探究</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20240905%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E5%80%BC%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20240905%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E5%80%BC%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p>对于 Linux bash 参数过长错误 “Argument list too long” 网上有很多解决方案，但并没有解释这个最大长度的值的范围。本着追根溯源的态度，本文对此问题做一个探究。记录下限制参数长度的因素以及最大长度。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Linux 安装基础知识</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20220518-linux%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/</link><pubDate>Wed, 18 May 2022 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20220518-linux%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="bios-mode">BIOS Mode</h2>
<p>将硬件资源抽象 传递给内核，引导内核。</p>
<ul>
<li>传统 windows BIOS : legacy</li>
<li><code>UEFI</code>（Unified Extensible Firmware Interface）统一可扩展固件接口：负责加电自检（POST）等。</li>
<li>嵌入式：pmon u-boot</li>
</ul>
<p><code>固件（firmware）</code>嵌入在硬件设备的软件。位于特殊应用集成电路（ASIC）或可编程逻辑器件（PLD）中的闪存，EEPROM或PROM中，有的可更新。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>如何准确判断rpm,yum,dnf进程是否阻塞[运行]？</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20220427-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%88%A4%E6%96%ADrpm%E5%92%8Cyum%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%98%BB%E5%A1%9E/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 Apr 2022 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20220427-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E5%88%A4%E6%96%ADrpm%E5%92%8Cyum%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%98%BB%E5%A1%9E/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>如果你是一个程序员，你会知道，<code>rpm</code>, <code>yum</code>, <code>dnf</code>这三个进程是否运行，如果运行，是否阻塞？</p>
<h2 id="简单常用但不严谨的做法">简单常用但不严谨的做法</h2>
<p>一个简单方法是通过 <code>ps -ef | grep rpm | grep -v grep</code> 命令来判断。</p>
<p>但这种方法有两个问题：</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Linux 磁盘挂载</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20210710-%E7%A3%81%E7%9B%98%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Jul 2021 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20210710-%E7%A3%81%E7%9B%98%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h3 id="查看磁盘">查看磁盘</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo fdisk -l
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo lsblk
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo mkfs -t ext4 /dev/mmcblk1 # 格式化
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo mount /dev/mmcblk1 /home/root/data/</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="卸载挂载">卸载挂载</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo umount /dev/mmcblk1</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="自动挂载">自动挂载</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo blkid # 获取UUID
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo vim /etc/fstab
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">UUID=6b7eaf8d-0b66-6e26-bdff-fa63f7dd1126 /u01 ext4 defaults 1 1</span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description></item><item><title>Linux下检测某个ip端口的连通状态</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20210121-linux%E4%B8%8B%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AAip%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9E%E9%80%9A%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 Jan 2021 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20210121-linux%E4%B8%8B%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AAip%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9E%E9%80%9A%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>举个例子，要测试的 ip+port: 192.168.0.100:8080</p>
